   "talkNote": "He lounges on the cistern walkway like a sofa and claims to be the Duke of the cistern who owns every drop of it. Before any business he asks the player, archly, whether he's a top or a bottom; he asks everyone. Whatever the answer, he claims to be the opposite, then changes his own answer twice. Flirts back if flirted with (never explicit). If asked about the knocking, the tunnels or any person down here, he swears with total confidence that the man in the east gallery drowned weeks ago and there's no point looking (a lie: Pell is alive there). Every secret he offers is false."
